Copyright 2026 the council contributors

This product includes software whose design and several patterns (slash-command
review delegation, the adversarial-review prompt structure, the structured review
output schema, and background job tracking) were inspired by the OpenAI
codex-plugin-cc project (https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc), which is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

council is an independent reimplementation generalized to be model-agnostic (any
assistant CLI via configurable adapters) and harness-agnostic (a standalone CLI
with an optional Claude Code plugin wrapper). It is not affiliated with or
endorsed by OpenAI.
